    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/b49ccdff9a8961881b2f6a294f89f802.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Build anything. Make it look real.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloxiti</strong> is a photorealistic sandbox builder made in Unreal Engine 5.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap high-fidelity blocks together like LEGO, sculpt materials in real time, and bring entire cities to life\u2014solo or on dedicated servers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Building</strong> \u2013 Place, rotate, and scale UE5 nanite blocks with a Minecraft-like system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/9cf3d92b152e13cf0a77b94d4a1592c6.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material Studio</strong> \u2013 Tweak color, metalness, glow, transparency, and wear directly in-game.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/105c627abe722059ccf3bac61fb24963.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamp Mode</strong> \u2013 Import images or decals and project them onto any surface.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/ce7c0683e3f05563cd3b93a0d3171933.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block &amp; Blueprint Studios</strong> \u2013 Combine parts into reusable \u201csuper blocks,\u201d save full builds, and share them with the community.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technik Blocks</strong> \u2013 Rotary, linear, and hinge components powered by a simple network system for moving doors, lifts, and machines.    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Worlds</strong> \u2013 Explore infinite, seed-based terrain rendered with Lumen global illumination.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer &amp; UGC</strong> \u2013 Host or join dedicated servers, trade blueprints, and collaborate on mega-builds.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Local Compute</strong> \u2013 No cloud streaming or AI dependence; everything runs on your PC for low-latency creation.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performance Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on DX12-class GPUs; GTX 1080 / RX 5700 XT = 1080 p/Medium \u2248 45 FPS.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSD strongly recommended for texture streaming.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance scales with newer hardware\u2014turn on Nanite &amp; full Lumen for 60 FPS+ at 1440 p on RTX 3070 / RX 6800 XT or better.  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/b49ccdff9a8961881b2f6a294f89f802.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Build anything. Make it look real.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloxiti</strong> is a photorealistic sandbox builder made in Unreal Engine 5.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap high-fidelity blocks together like LEGO, sculpt materials in real time, and bring entire cities to life\u2014solo or on dedicated servers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Building</strong> \u2013 Place, rotate, and scale UE5 nanite blocks with a Minecraft-like system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/9cf3d92b152e13cf0a77b94d4a1592c6.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material Studio</strong> \u2013 Tweak color, metalness, glow, transparency, and wear directly in-game.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/105c627abe722059ccf3bac61fb24963.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamp Mode</strong> \u2013 Import images or decals and project them onto any surface.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716900/extras/ce7c0683e3f05563cd3b93a0d3171933.avif?t=1746718158\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block &amp; Blueprint Studios</strong> \u2013 Combine parts into reusable \u201csuper blocks,\u201d save full builds, and share them with the community.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technik Blocks</strong> \u2013 Rotary, linear, and hinge components powered by a simple network system for moving doors, lifts, and machines.    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Worlds</strong> \u2013 Explore infinite, seed-based terrain rendered with Lumen global illumination.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer &amp; UGC</strong> \u2013 Host or join dedicated servers, trade blueprints, and collaborate on mega-builds.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Local Compute</strong> \u2013 No cloud streaming or AI dependence; everything runs on your PC for low-latency creation.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performance Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on DX12-class GPUs; GTX 1080 / RX 5700 XT = 1080 p/Medium \u2248 45 FPS.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSD strongly recommended for texture streaming.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance scales with newer hardware\u2014turn on Nanite &amp; full Lumen for 60 FPS+ at 1440 p on RTX 3070 / RX 6800 XT or better.  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bloxiti is a photorealistic builder where you snap and stack blocks to craft cozy cabins, massive megastructures, or peaceful dioramas.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
