    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (1909, build 18363) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \u2605 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080 (8 GB) or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> \u2022 Requires a 64-bit CPU &amp; OS \u2022 Targets 1080 p / Medium \u2248 30 FPS with Nanite &amp; Lumen OFF \u2022 SSD improves streaming stutter</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K \u2605 / AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3070 8 GB / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT 16 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> \u2022 Targets 1440 p / High \u2248 60 FPS with Nanite &amp; Lumen ON \u2022 Performance scales with newer GPUs (RTX 4070 + / RX 7900 XT +)</li></ul>"
